                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "We've played the first area and 2 of the 12 levels on the second. Its a lot of fun for my 6 year old to try to figure out the clues. Its not super easy to get all the coins either so it's nice for us to work together on figuring out how to get all the coins and the dragon. For $.99 it's already paid for itself and we  have only just started. It does not require a lot of movement so it's perfect for smaller VR setups. Highly recommend it for families and people who like puzzle games.\n\nIf you enjoyed my review please consider following and joining my Steam group\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/MatureMindedGamers#curation]Mature Minded Gamers[/url]\nWe have free game giveaway's every month for all Members, just click Follow and Join!",
